  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.95</data>
  <data key="d37">A reduction in the physical flow of crude, diesel or LNG tightens near-term supply relative to demand and pushes up cash (spot) prices for oil and refined fuels.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
