  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A drop in Russian hydrocarbon exports forces EU buyers to outcompete Asian buyers for alternative LNG/oil cargoes and charter capacity, raising freight and energy input costs and causing a measurable contraction in China‑EU manufactured goods trade volumes as supply chains and shipping slots are reallocated.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_trade_rivalry</data>
