  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Reductions in Russia-related hydrocarbon flows (pipeline outages, export curbs) tighten immediate physical availability in global markets, driving benchmark crude and diesel prices up within weeks.</data>
