  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated collective uncertainty about future supply, demand and policy prompts authorities to escalate regulatory, fiscal or emergency interventions (e.g., releases, price controls, advisories) to stabilize markets and reassure participants.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
