  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising uncertainty about future supply/demand encourages commercial and strategic actors to build precautionary onshore and floating stocks, increasing aggregate storage volumes as insurance against shocks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_ris</data>
