  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp rises in oil spot prices prompt rapid government interventions (SPR releases, subsidies, export controls, taxes or advisories) aimed at stabilizing markets or shielding consumers, increasing policy action intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_ris</data>
