  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating interstate conflict raises war premiums, reduces available safe/insured tonnage (via flagging and owner withdrawals), and lengthens voyages through detours, driving up charter costs for tankers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
