  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in geopolitical conflict intensity prompts states and coalitions to impose new sanctions, export controls and transit restrictions aimed at adversaries or their partners, expanding the scope and severity of trade restrictions relevant to Iran and its proxies.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
