  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in overall geopolitical conflict intensity raises incentives, resources and operational cover for kinetic strikes, sabotage and proxy attacks against production, refining and transport nodes, increasing the frequency of energy-infrastructure attacks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
