  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher assessed risk to key maritime, pipeline or air corridors leads to rerouting, port shutdowns, convoy slowdowns and insurance refusals that directly reduce the net physical flow of crude, refined fuels and LNG into markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
