  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher spot commodity prices raise the potential payoff from capturing or disrupting energy shipments, which increases incentives for Iran-aligned proxies and opportunistic actors to mount attacks on energy logistics, raising incident frequency.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
