  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp increases in spot oil and gas prices trigger governments and regulators to deploy fiscal and regulatory measures (strategic reserve releases, subsidies, price controls, export rules) to blunt economic impacts, elevating the intensity of policy responses.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
