  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">New export controls, sanctions or emergency trade measures implemented by governments (e.g., export bans, licensing requirements) immediately reduce cross‑border energy and dual‑use flows between China and EU counterparties.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_compute_chip_race</data>
