  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Intense policy actions in a crisis frequently include coordinated strategic reserve releases or mandated emergency sales that directly reduce on‑hand hydrocarbon inventories.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
