  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalation of China–EU trade measures (sanctions, export controls or port denials) directly interrupts production, export approvals and transit of crude and refined shipments between facilities, reducing the aggregate physical crude movement rate.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_eu_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_ris</data>
